This query will group the documents in the 'countrylanguage' collection by country and count the number of occurrences for each language. It then sorts the results in descending order based on the count, limits the result to the top document (the one with the largest count), projects only the country and language fields, and finally groups the results again to get the language spoken by the largest percentage of people in each country.;
